label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	ReynaMayari: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	ReynaMayari: Just strolling past as ordinary Maria. Your awning shade is surprisingly pleasant.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	ReynaMayari: No ledger business right now. I only wanted to see Karimlan bustling in daylight.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Biringan is spotless and terribly quiet. Your street is much better company, shopkeeper.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	ReynaMayari: Do not mind me. I am simply admiring how orderly your candy shelf looks.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	ReynaMayari: Your neighbors barely blink at a stranger in fine shades. I like this street.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Keep your ledger sharp and your snacks cold, shopkeeper. That is royal advice.
[end_timeline]
